  "title": "Apple Pork Chops",
  "description": "Apple pork chops with a sweet, tangy sauce of brown sugar, mustard, and cloves. This dish is a classic combo of apples and pork, baked to perfection.",
  "authors": [
    "MNKENNEY"
  ],
